msgid ""
"The local service otherwise records every visitor as this "
"router.\n\nConfigure the service first: until both ends agree, every "
"request fails.\n\nnginx, on the port this tunnel points at:\n    listen "
"PORT proxy_protocol;\n    set_real_ip_from THIS-ROUTER-LAN-ADDRESS;\n    "
"real_ip_header proxy_protocol;"
msgstr "不開啟的話，內網服務會把每個訪客都記成本路由器。\n\n先設定好服務再開這個：兩邊沒對上之前，所有請求都會失敗。\n\nnginx，在本隧道指向的連接埠上：\n    listen 連接埠 proxy_protocol;\n    set_real_ip_from 本路由器的內網位址;\n    real_ip_header proxy_protocol;"

msgid ""
"No server of your own is needed. cloudflared runs here and connects out "
"to Cloudflare, which routes your domains back down that connection.\n\nA "
"tunnel published this way serves HTTP only, Cloudflare terminates TLS "
"at its edge, and the visitor address arrives in a header — so "
"certificates, TLS handling, remote ports and the PROXY protocol do not "
"apply to it."
msgstr "不需要你自己的伺服器。cloudflared 跑在本路由器上，向外連到 Cloudflare，由它把你的域名路由回這條連線。\n\n這種方式發布的隧道只支援 HTTP，TLS 由 Cloudflare 在邊緣終止，訪客位址透過標頭傳入 —— 所以憑證、TLS 處理方式、遠程連接埠和 PROXY 協議對它都不適用。"

msgid "%d days left"
msgstr "剩餘 %d 天"

msgid "%d stored"
msgstr "已存 %d 項"

msgid "%s accepted the credentials."
msgstr "%s 接受了該憑證。"

msgid "%s is not in the expected format"
msgstr "%s 格式不正確"

msgid "%s is required"
msgstr "%s 不能為空"

msgid "%s is too broad; a wildcard needs a domain beneath it"
msgstr "%s 範圍過大；泛網域下面必須還有一級網域"

msgid "%s issues only to accounts it already knows, so it needs a key pair created in your %s account. This is stored once and reused for every certificate from that authority."
msgstr "%s 只向它已知的帳號簽發，因此需要一對在你的 %s 帳號裡建立的金鑰。它只需儲存一次，之後該機構的所有憑證都會重複使用。"

msgid "%s issues only to accounts it already knows. Create a pair in your %s account and paste it here."
msgstr "%s 只向它已知的帳號簽發。請在你的 %s 帳號裡建立一對金鑰並貼上到這裡。"

msgid "%s needs an account binding"
msgstr "%s 需要帳號綁定"

msgid "%s needs external account binding credentials."
msgstr "%s 需要外部帳號綁定（EAB）憑證。"

msgid "A Cloudflare tunnel publishes hostnames over HTTP. Point this tunnel at a server of your own for %s."
msgstr "Cloudflare Tunnel 只能以 HTTP 發布域名。要用 %s，請把本隧道指向你自己的伺服器。"

msgid "A \"*\" label matches exactly one level and may appear at any depth: *.aaa.com matches www.aaa.com but not x.bb.aaa.com. Exact names win over wildcards, and deeper wildcards win over shallower ones."
msgstr "\"*\" 標籤只比對一層，可以出現在任意深度：*.aaa.com 比對 www.aaa.com，但不比對 x.bb.aaa.com。精確網域優先於泛網域，層級更深的泛網域優先於更淺的。"

msgid "A blank host will do. The connection details are filled in from whatever the deployment installs."
msgstr "一台空白主機就行。連線資訊會由部署結果自動填入。"

msgid "A domain needs at least two labels, for example aaa.com"
msgstr "網域至少要有兩級，例如 aaa.com"

msgid "A name is required"
msgstr "名稱不能為空"

msgid "A name you will recognise, for example aliyun-main"
msgstr "一個你能認出來的名稱，例如 aliyun-main"

msgid "A tunnel will not work through the proxy: it carries only HTTP and HTTPS on its own ports, and terminates TLS. Use DNS only for names that point at your tunnel server."
msgstr "通道無法透過代理運作：代理只承載它自己那幾個連接埠上的 HTTP 和 HTTPS，而且會終止 TLS。指向穿透伺服器的網域請用「僅 DNS」。"

msgid "A wildcard can only be proved through DNS."
msgstr "泛網域只能透過 DNS 驗證。"

msgid "A wildcard can only be proved through DNS. Select an account."
msgstr "泛網域只能透過 DNS 驗證，請選擇一個帳號。"

msgid "Accounts"
msgstr "帳號"

msgid "Accounts here are used to manage records and to prove domain ownership when issuing certificates. A wildcard certificate can only be issued through DNS, so it needs an account."
msgstr "這裡的帳號用於管理解析記錄，以及在簽發憑證時證明網域歸屬。泛網域憑證只能透過 DNS 驗證簽發，因此必須設定帳號。"

