msgid "No DNS accounts are configured. Add one on the DNS page first — a wildcard certificate cannot be issued without it."
msgstr "尚未設定 DNS 帳號。請先在 DNS 頁面新增一個 —— 沒有它無法簽發泛網域憑證。"

msgid "No DNS accounts yet. Add one to manage records and to issue wildcard certificates."
