msgid "Off by default, unlike frp. Multiplexing puts every tunnel behind one congestion window, so a single lost packet stalls them all, and it rules out the kernel zero-copy path. Enable only when the number of open sockets matters more than throughput."
msgstr "與 frp 不同，此項預設關閉。多工會讓所有通道共用一個壅塞視窗，一個封包遺失就會拖住全部通道，而且無法走核心零複製。只有當通訊端數量比傳輸量更重要時才啟用。"

msgid "One label only: letters, digits and dashes."
msgstr "只能是一段：字母、數字和短橫線。"

msgid "One per line. A \"*\" covers exactly one level, so *.aiqno.com covers acgshop.aiqno.com but not a.b.aiqno.com."
msgstr "每行一個。「*」只涵蓋一層，所以 *.aiqno.com 涵蓋 acgshop.aiqno.com，但不涵蓋 a.b.aiqno.com。"

msgid "Only certificates covering every domain of this tunnel are listed. Pushed to the server and hot-loaded, without dropping a connection. Only a bound tunnel has its certificate pushed."
msgstr "只列出能涵蓋本隧道全部域名的憑證。推送到伺服器熱載入，不會斷開任何連線。只有綁定了憑證的隧道才會推送。"

